        "repo": "order-service",
        "runtime_status": "broken",
        "evidence": "`AccountClient` reads `postalCode`, while the proposed provider response emits only `postcode`. The resulting missing postal value reaches `ShipmentClient`, whose `Map.of` request body cannot contain a null value, so normal quote creation cannot reach its shipment-estimate HTTP call."
      },
      {
        "repo": "shipment-service",
        "runtime_status": "unchanged",
        "evidence": "Its estimate request contract still binds `postalCode`; no shipment HTTP request is reached from the broken Order flow."
      }
    ],
